:"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000206.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000206.docx:M04:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"４ トマトとじゃがいもが合わせて32個ある。トマトの数はじゃがいもの数の 2 倍より 2 個多いという。トマトとじゃがいもの数をそれぞれ求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"トマト 22個\nじゃがいも 10個","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000206.docx:M05:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000206","minor":"大問5","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000206","M05","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000206 M05-S01","skill":"原本構造 M05/S01","question_format":"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000206.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000206.docx:M05:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"５ 2けたの自然数がある。十の位の数は一の位の数の 2 倍より3 小さい。また、十の位と一の位の数を入れかえてできる数は、もとの自然数より18 小さいという。もとの自然数を求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"75","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000207.docx:M01:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000207","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000207","M01","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000207 M01-S01","skill":"原本構造 M01/S01","question_format":"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000207.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000207.docx:M01:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１ Aさんは 7時に自宅を出発して 2800m 離れた学校へ向かった。はじめは毎分80mの速さで歩いていたが、途中から毎分240mの速さで走ったら学校に7時19分に着いた。Aさんが歩いた道のりを求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"880m","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_r