it":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000313","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000313","M01","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000313 M01-S01","skill":"原本構造 M01/S01","question_format":"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000313.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M01:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１ 次の問いに答えなさい。 A市の水道料金は、10m^(3)から50m^(3)までの範囲で、使用量の1次関数になる。ある家庭の水道料金は、6月は18m^(3)使って1950円、８月は26m^(3)使って3150円であった。9月の使用量が21m^(3)であるとき、水道料金はいくらか、求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"2400円","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M01:S02","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000313","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000313","M01","S02"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000313 M01-S02","skill":"原本構造 M01/S02","question_format":"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000313.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M01:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１ 次の問いに答えなさい。 長さが 30cm のつるまきばねがある。重さが 20kg までの範囲では、ばねの長さはおもりの重さの1次関数になるという。このばねに 3kg のおもりをつるすとばねの長さは36cmになる。10kgのおもりをつるすときのばねの長さを求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"50cm","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M01:S03","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000313","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000313","M01","S03"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000313 M01-S03","skill":"原本構造 M01/S03","question_format":"free_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000313.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M01:S03","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１ 次の問いに答えなさい。 ある学校で記念文集をつくる。費用は、400冊で28万円、600冊では32万円になるという。文集をつくる費用 y 万円は、文集の冊数 x の1次関数になるとして、文集を100冊つくるにはいくらかかるか求めなさい。","choices":null,"answer":"22万円","explanation":"","figure_refs":[],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M02:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000313","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000313","M02","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000313 M02-S01","skill":"原本構造 M02/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000313.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M02:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"２ Aさんの家から公園までの歩行グラフについて、家から公園までのAさんの歩く速さを求めなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/64288c007e8c1270bab724dca98434af75d7108e373da3f476981d9517da3225.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"毎分100m","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/64288c007e8c1270bab724dca98434af75d7108e373da3f476981d9517da3225.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M02:S02","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000313","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000313","M02","S02"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000313 M02-S02","skill":"原本構造 M02/S02","question_format":"graphical_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000313.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000313.docx:M02:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"２ Aさんが家を出て30分後に弟が毎分150mで追いかけたとき、弟の進んだようすを右の図にかき入れなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/64288c007e8c1270bab724dca98434af75d7108e373da3f476981d9517da3225.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"[作図解答] x=30で0mから始まる傾き150m/分の直線 y=150(x-30)","explanation":"","figure_refs":["as