estion_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M01:S03","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"⑵ 角の二等分線上の点から各辺までの距離は等しい。仮定を図の記号を使って式で表しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/8f25d44cff7446d7a9eff51ec61a4ded9f6a91c886f035b86a5ac6e4f091f264.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"∠AOP=∠BOP","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/8f25d44cff7446d7a9eff51ec61a4ded9f6a91c886f035b86a5ac6e4f091f264.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M01:S04","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000417","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000417","M01","S04"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000417 M01-S04","skill":"原本構造 M01/S04","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M01:S04","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"⑵ 角の二等分線上の点から各辺までの距離は等しい。結論を図の記号を使って式で表しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/8f25d44cff7446d7a9eff51ec61a4ded9f6a91c886f035b86a5ac6e4f091f264.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"AP=BP","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/8f25d44cff7446d7a9eff51ec61a4ded9f6a91c886f035b86a5ac6e4f091f264.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000417","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000417","M02","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000417 M02-S01","skill":"原本構造 M02/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"右の図で、△BCDは∠C=∠Dの二等辺三角形で、BE∥CD。このときEBが∠ABCの二等分線になる。⑴ 仮定を式で表しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"∠C=∠D、BE∥CD","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S02","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000417","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000417","M02","S02"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000417 M02-S02","skill":"原本構造 M02/S02","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"同じ図について、⑴ 結論を式で表しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"∠ABE=∠CBE","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S03","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000417","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000417","M02","S03"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000417 M02-S03","skill":"原本構造 M02/S03","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M02:S03","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"同じ図について、⑵ EBが∠ABCの二等分線になることを証明しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"BE∥CDより、同位角が等しいので、∠D=∠ABE…①。錯角が等しいので、∠C=∠CBE…②。仮定より、∠C=∠D…③。①～③より、∠ABE=∠CBE。よって、EBは∠ABCの二等分線になる。","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/60dbaedaa5c374dac1392731dc50f63aea93bcad840806749272127ddf66096e.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M03:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000417","minor":"大問3","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000417","M03","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000417 M03-S01","skill":"原本構造 M03/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000417.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000417.docx:M03:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"右の図で、∠B=∠C、DB=ECである。このとき、△DBC≡△ECBであることを証明しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/283b25c06de612148e1f4c55b9aa09a6cf6fb7bcc54fabfb5e757bc11d73a32a.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"△DBCと△ECBで、仮定より、∠B=∠C…①、DB=EC…②。また、底辺は共通だからBC=CB…③。①～③より、2組の辺とその間の角がそれぞれ等しいので、△DBC≡△ECB。","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/283b25c06de612148e1f4c55b9aa09a6cf6fb7bcc54fabfb5e757bc11d73a32a.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000518.docx:M01:S01","grade":2,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst2suhy000518","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中2","25winpasst2suhy000518","M01","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中2 25winpasst2suhy000518 M01-S01","skill":"原本構造 M01/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst2suhy000518.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst2suhy000518.docx:M01:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"下の図で、同じ印をつけた辺の長さが等しいとき、∠xの大きさを求めなさい。(1)\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/f42645b226cea65b2a920be2b7c1899f150b7a7d7deb821470b2d0f7259bd28b.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"115°","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/f42645b226cea65b2a9