:true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000105.docx:M03:S01","grade":3,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst3suhy000105","minor":"大問3","tags":["Winpass","中3","25winpasst3suhy000105","M03","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中3 25winpasst3suhy000105 M03-S01","skill":"原本構造 M03/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst3suhy000105.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000105.docx:M03:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"３ 右の図のように、1辺がx cmの正方形の縦を2cm短くし、横を2cm長くして長方形をつくる。⑴ できた長方形の縦と横の長さを、それぞれxを使った式で表しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/133df1306cee6968c2069e3eff863340d10095189521a8430882ce579f61e455.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"縦…x-2(cm)、横…x+2(cm)","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/133df1306cee6968c2069e3eff863340d10095189521a8430882ce579f61e455.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000105.docx:M03:S02","grade":3,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst3suhy000105","minor":"大問3","tags":["Winpass","中3","25winpasst3suhy000105","M03","S02"]},"title":"Winpass 中3 25winpasst3suhy000105 M03-S02","skill":"原本構造 M03/S02","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst3suhy000105.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000105.docx:M03:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"３ 右の図のように、1辺がx cmの正方形の縦を2cm短くし、横を2cm長くして長方形をつくる。⑵ もとの正方形の面積は、できた長方形の面積よりどれだけ大きいですか。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/133df1306cee6968c2069e3eff863340d10095189521a8430882ce579f61e455.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"4cm^(2)","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/133df1306cee6968c2069e3eff863340d10095189521a8430882ce579f61e455.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000206.docx:M01:S01"