 / 25winpasst3suhy000523","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中3","25winpasst3suhy000523","M01","S01"]},"title":"Winpass 中3 25winpasst3suhy000523 M01-S01","skill":"原本構造 M01/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst3suhy000523.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000523.docx:M01:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１　右の図で、4点A、B、C、Dは円Oの周上にあり、弦ACと弦BDはEで交わる。AE=5cm、CE=4cm、DE=3cmのとき、BEの長さを求めなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/f23c70aaa2528fc6df6957599fa606f863a51d10fb267da78640db263c4f4b20.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"20/3 cm","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/f23c70aaa2528fc6df6957599fa606f863a51d10fb267da78640db263c4f4b20.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000523.docx:M01:S02","grade":3,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst3suhy000523","minor":"大問1","tags":["Winpass","中3","25winpasst3suhy000523","M01","S02"]},"title":"Winpass 中3 25winpasst3suhy000523 M01-S02","skill":"原本構造 M01/S02","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Winpass","document":"25winpasst3suhy000523.docx","original_no":"Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000523.docx:M01:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１　右の図で、4点A、B、C、Dは円Oの周上にあり、弦ACと弦BDはEで交わる。△AED∽△BECであることを証明しなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/f23c70aaa2528fc6df6957599fa606f863a51d10fb267da78640db263c4f4b20.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"△AEDと△BECで、弧ABに対する円周角より∠ADE=∠BCE。対頂角より∠AED=∠BEC。よって2組の角がそれぞれ等しいので、△AED∽△BEC。","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/f23c70aaa2528fc6df6957599fa606f863a51d10fb267da78640db263c4f4b20.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Winpass:25winpasst3suhy000523.docx:M02:S01","grade":3,"unit":{"major":"Winpass / 25winpasst3suhy000523","minor":"大問2","tags":["Winpass","中3","25winpasst3suhy000523",