 C がある。また，点 D は線分 AC の中点である。AB=18cm，AC=14cm のとき，次の問いに答えなさい。 ⑴ 線分 AD の長さを求めなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/081de2e9ebf111f65a4679a7f5a29cea325e2c9d38fe855d69e1681da61fe234.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"7cm","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/081de2e9ebf111f65a4679a7f5a29cea325e2c9d38fe855d69e1681da61fe234.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Standard:25astandardt1suhy000520:M01:S02","grade":1,"unit":{"major":"Standard / 25astandardt1suhy000520","minor":"大問1","tags":["Standard","中1","25astandardt1suhy000520","M01","S02"]},"title":"Standard 中1 25astandardt1suhy000520 M01-S02","skill":"原本構造 M01/S02","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Standard","document":"25astandardt1suhy000520.docx","original_no":"Standard:25astandardt1suhy000520:M01:S02","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"１ 右の図のように，線分 AB 上に点 C がある。また，点 D は線分 AC の中点である。AB=18cm，AC=14cm のとき，次の問いに答えなさい。 ⑵ 線分 AB の中点を M とするとき，線分 MC の長さを求めなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/081de2e9ebf111f65a4679a7f5a29cea325e2c9d38fe855d69e1681da61fe234.png]]","choices":null,"answer":"5cm","explanation":"","figure_refs":["assets/math/081de2e9ebf111f65a4679a7f5a29cea325e2c9d38fe855d69e1681da61fe234.png"],"variant_group":null,"audit":{"problem_answer_verified":true,"structure_verified":true,"figure_refs_verified":true}},{"id":"orig:Standard:25astandardt1suhy000520:M02:S01","grade":1,"unit":{"major":"Standard / 25astandardt1suhy000520","minor":"大問2","tags":["Standard","中1","25astandardt1suhy000520","M02","S01"]},"title":"Standard 中1 25astandardt1suhy000520 M02-S01","skill":"原本構造 M02/S01","question_format":"figure_response","difficulty":"unknown","source":{"book":"Standard","document":"25astandardt1suhy000520.docx","original_no":"Standard:25astandardt1suhy000520:M02:S01","is_generated_variant":false},"question":"２ 右の図について，次の問いに答えなさい。 ⑴ ∠ABE は，a ～ e のどの角を表すか，答えなさい。\n[[IMAGE:assets/math/ffb3cfa6502f6cfa4a